    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Each Performance Stock Equivalent (&quot;PSE&quot;) is convertible into one share of common stock of Edgewell Personal Care Company (&quot;EPC&quot;).  The performance conditions with respect to 5,773 PSEs were satisfied and vested into EPC common stock on November 13, 2025.  The remaining 10,580 PSEs did not satisfy the necessary performance conditions and were canceled on the same date.</footnote>
