        <footnote id="F3">Reflects an award of PSEs for which the performance conditions were satisfied on November 6, 2025 and remaining time vesting conditions were satisfied on November 13, 2025.  Each PSE is convertible into shares of EPC common stock.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">Each Restricted Stock Equivalent (&quot;RSE&quot;) is convertible into one share of EPC common stock.  The award of RSEs shall vest as to one-third of the original grant of 15,445 RSEs on each of the first three anniversaries of the grant date.</footnote>
